{"id":"5acae5514919cc4d","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-system-f-empty-type.md","title":"System F的空类型无封闭居民","display":"thm-system-f-empty-type — System F的空类型无封闭居民","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-system-f-empty-type","aliases":["72-thm-system-f-empty-type"],"display":"thm-system-f-empty-type — System F的空类型无封闭居民","depends_on":["[[72-thm-system-f-normalization]]","[[72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §10.4 print397–398/PDF409–410 (related richer polymorphic system, contextual reference); supplementary Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), §11.3.3 print84/PDF92 and ch.14 print114–118/PDF122–126, https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf; local normalization corollary for constant-free System F","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-system-f-empty-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-system-f-empty-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-system-f-empty-type — System F的空类型无封闭居民"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99aa8943f30c6e5e\" href=\"?note=99aa8943f30c6e5e\" title=\"72-thm-system-f-normalization\">72-thm-system-f-normalization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06b025d5c611f287\" href=\"?note=06b025d5c611f287\" title=\"72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction\">72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §10.4 print397–398/PDF409–410 (related richer polymorphic system, contextual reference); supplementary Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), §11.3.3 print84/PDF92 and ch.14 print114–118/PDF122–126, <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>; local normalization corollary for constant-free System F"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in V_T\">\\(U\\in V_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall U.U\">\\(\\forall U.U\\)</span> 是本册 System F 的类型树；没有额外项常元或非逻辑公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\Lambda_F\">\\(M\\in\\Lambda_F\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists M\\in\\Lambda_F\\ (\\varnothing\\vdash_F M:\\forall U.U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists M\\in\\Lambda_F\\ (\\varnothing\\vdash_F M:\\forall U.U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若有居民，强正规化及类型保持给相同类型的封闭正规居民。正规项的应用脊只能以变量或未被消去的引入构造为头；封闭性排除变量，顶端为全称类型因而必须是ΛU.N。其体在空项上下文中为原子类型U的正规项。原子结果的正规项必须是以项变量为头的中性项，但空上下文没有这种变量，矛盾。依赖上游强正规化的一般证明资格，不将这个推论称为本轮重新独立证明了 System F 的强正规化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-system-f-normalization","status":"resolved","id":"99aa8943f30c6e5e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-system-f-normalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"06b025d5c611f287","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in V_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall U.U","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\Lambda_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists M\\in\\Lambda_F\\ (\\varnothing\\vdash_F M:\\forall U.U).","display":true}],"bytes":1808,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"}],"outgoing":["99aa8943f30c6e5e","06b025d5c611f287"]}